# The build context is the repository root (the image installs libs/runfile beside the viewer and carries libs/web): only what the Dockerfile
# copies goes in. Nothing of the lab's data (robots/duck/runs, ...) is ever sent to the daemon.
*
!libs/runfile/pyproject.toml
!libs/runfile/src
!libs/web
!apps/observatory/pyproject.toml
!apps/observatory/uv.lock
!apps/observatory/src
!apps/observatory/web
**/__pycache__/
